{% comment %}
  Por El Deporte — Abandoned checkout email.

  WHERE THIS GOES
  Shopify admin > Settings > Notifications > Customer notifications >
  Abandoned checkout > Edit code. Replace the whole body with this file.
  There is no Admin API for notification templates, so it is a paste.

  SUBJECT LINE (set in the field above the code editor):
      You left something in your bag

  Not "Your cart is ready for checkout". That is a status update about a
  database row. The subject is the only part most people read, so it should
  sound like a person noticing, not a system reporting.

  WHY IT LOOKS LIKE THIS
  Table layout with inline styles, because Gmail strips <style> blocks and
  Outlook renders with Word. No web fonts: Flapjack will not load in most
  clients, so the display type is heavy uppercase Helvetica with wide tracking,
  which reads as deliberate rather than as a failed font swap.

  The one thing this email has that a generic one does not is the reason to
  buy from this shop rather than any shop, so that is given its own band above
  the button rather than buried in a footer.

  URLS ARE HARDCODED ON PURPOSE. {{ shop.url }} resolves to the online store
  (por-el-deporte.myshopify.com), which is the old themed shop, not the Hydrogen
  storefront, and it does not serve /icon-192.png at all. {{ url }} is left as
  Liquid because that one is the checkout recovery link and must stay dynamic.
{% endcomment %}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{{ shop.name }}</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#efe7d3;">

    {% comment %} Preheader: the grey line Gmail shows after the subject. Hidden in the body. {% endcomment %}
    <div style="display:none; font-size:1px; color:#efe7d3; line-height:1px; max-height:0; max-width:0; opacity:0; overflow:hidden;">
      Free shipping in the U.S. and 30 days to change your mind.
    </div>

    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#efe7d3;">
      <tr>
        <td align="center" style="padding:28px 12px 40px 12px;">

          <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px; max-width:600px; background-color:#f7f0de; border:2px solid #171717; border-radius:18px; overflow:hidden;">

            <!-- Crest -->
            <tr>
              <td align="center" bgcolor="#171717" style="background-color:#171717; padding:26px 24px;">
                <img src="https://poreldeporte.com/icon-192.png" width="60" height="60" alt="{{ shop.name }}"
                     style="display:block; border:0; width:60px; height:60px; border-radius:14px;" />
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Headline -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:40px 40px 0 40px;">
                <p style="margin:0 0 14px 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#a55032;">
                  Est. 2014 Key Biscayne
                </p>
                <h1 style="margin:0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:38px; line-height:1.05; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:-0.5px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#171717;">
                  You left the<br />kit behind
                </h1>
                <p style="margin:18px 0 0 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.6; color:#4a463d;">
                  Still here whenever you want it. We held on to your bag.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Items -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:30px 40px 0 40px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                  {% for line in line_items %}
                  <tr>
                    <td width="96" valign="top" style="padding:0 18px 18px 0;">
                      <img src="{{ line | img_url: 'medium' }}" width="96" alt="{{ line.title }}"
                           style="display:block; border:0; width:96px; height:auto; background-color:#e6dcc4; border-radius:12px;" />
                    </td>
                    <td valign="top" style="padding:0 0 18px 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
                      <p style="margin:0 0 5px 0; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; line-height:1.25; color:#171717; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.3px;">
                        {{ line.title }}
                      </p>
                      {% unless line.variant.title == 'Default Title' %}
                      <p style="margin:0 0 4px 0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.4; color:#6b665b;">
                        {{ line.variant.title }}
                      </p>
                      {% endunless %}
                      <p style="margin:0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.4; color:#6b665b;">
                        Qty {{ line.quantity }}
                      </p>
                    </td>
                    <td valign="top" align="right" style="padding:0 0 18px 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; color:#171717; white-space:nowrap;">
                      {{ line.line_price | money }}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  {% endfor %}
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Subtotal -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:6px 40px 0 40px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-top:1px solid #d8cdb2;">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:18px 0 0 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6b665b;">
                      Subtotal
                    </td>
                    <td align="right" style="padding:18px 0 0 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:bold; color:#171717;">
                      {{ subtotal_price | money }}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- The reason to buy here rather than anywhere -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:28px 40px 0 40px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#a55032; border-radius:12px;">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:18px 22px; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.55; color:#f7f0de;">
                      Every order pays for pitch time, balls and the next match.
                      The games have always been free to turn up to, and we would
                      like to keep it that way.
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- CTA -->
            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="padding:30px 40px 0 40px;">
                <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td align="center" bgcolor="#171717" style="background-color:#171717; border-radius:999px;">
                      <a href="{{ url }}"
                         style="display:inline-block; padding:19px 52px; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1.6px; text-transform:uppercase; color:#f7f0de; text-decoration:none; border-radius:999px;">
                        Finish checkout
                      </a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
                <p style="margin:16px 0 0 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:1.5; color:#6b665b;">
                  Free shipping in the U.S. &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 30 days to change your mind
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Help -->
            <tr>
              <td style="padding:30px 40px 40px 40px;">
                <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border-top:1px solid #d8cdb2;">
                  <tr>
                    <td style="padding:20px 0 0 0; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#6b665b;">
                      Sold out in your size, or want something changed? Reply to
                      this email and a person will answer.
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
              </td>
            </tr>

          </table>

          <!-- Footer. Shopify appends the store address and unsubscribe below this. -->
          <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px; max-width:600px;">
            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="padding:24px 24px 0 24px; font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:12px; line-height:1.7; color:#8a8577;">
                <a href="https://poreldeporte.com" style="color:#8a8577; text-decoration:underline;">Por El Deporte</a>
                &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;
                <a href="https://poreldeporte.com/collections/all-products" style="color:#8a8577; text-decoration:underline;">Shop</a>
                &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp;
                <a href="https://poreldeporte.com/policies/refund-policy" style="color:#8a8577; text-decoration:underline;">Returns</a>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>

        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
